---
layout: refonte
title: Interventions
permalink: /refonte/interventions/
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav aria-label="Fil d'Ariane">
      <ol class="breadcrumb">
        <li><a href="/refonte/">Accueil</a></li>
        <li aria-current="page">Interventions</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <p class="kicker">Conférences, formations</p>
    <h1>Mes <em>interventions</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Conférences, formations et ateliers autour de l'accessibilité numérique,
      de l'IA et de la qualité web — depuis 2010.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <ul class="interventions-list">
      {% for post in collections.interventions | reverse %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">
          <span class="interventions-list__year">{{ post.data.date.getFullYear() }}</span>
          <span>
            <span class="interventions-list__title">{{ post.data.title | e }}</span>
            {% if post.data.description %}
            <span class="interventions-list__title-desc">{{ post.data.description }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </span>
          <span class="interventions-list__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
